Material of GSC Game World
==========================

The pictures on twenty-two cards of the stalkers' deck show the S.T.A.L.K.E.R.
games. Twenty-one are cut from the files of the games; Faust's is a picture of
S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2 that those files do not hold (art/cards/stalker/src/SOURCES.md
says where each one comes from). They are the source pictures in
art/cards/stalker/src, and those cards as they are drawn into art/cards/stalker,
OpenZone_Games/gui/imagesets/ozg_cards_stalker_ca.paa,
OpenZone_Games/data/cards/ozg_deck_stalker_co.paa and
OpenZone_Games/data/cards/stalker. The loners' patch sewn on the cloth of the
stalkers' table is cut from the files of S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: the source picture
in art/table/src, and the cloth as it is drawn into
art/table/ozg_table_cloth_co.png and
OpenZone_Games/gui/textures/ozg_table_cloth_co.paa. The figurines of the
stalker chess set are posed from the models and textures of the original
S.T.A.L.K.E.R. trilogy and baked from them: models/src/chess_stalker.obj,
models/chess_stalker, OpenZone_Games/models/chess_stalker, their pictures in
art/pieces/stalker and OpenZone_Games/gui/imagesets/ozg_pieces_stalker_ca.paa.
The faces of the stalker draughts are the trilogy's portraits: models/disc/data/
ozg_disc_stalker_*_co.png, OpenZone_Games/models/disc/data/ozg_disc_stalker_*,
art/discs/stalker and OpenZone_Games/gui/imagesets/ozg_discs_stalker_ca.paa.
They are created and fully owned by GSC Game World. They are NOT covered by the
licence above, and no permission given in this file extends to them.

OpenZone Games is a fan-made mod. Its stalkers' deck and its stalker set of
chess and draughts are based on the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. universe and use its assets. The mod is not official and has no
affiliation with GSC Game World. The original games are sold here:

    https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/stalker

The assets are used on the terms GSC Game World states for the use of its assets
in mods of other games (as published on the Steam Workshop page of the GSC
assets pack for DayZ, item 2868091107): the mod stays non-commercial at all
times, makes plain that it is unofficial, links to the store pages of the
original games, and follows GSC's content guidelines. Those terms are not a
licence and waive none of GSC's rights.

    Зображення на двадцяти двох картах сталкерської колоди і нашивка вільних
